# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# RUN ARTEFACTS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Result metrics (small .jsonl) ARE published -- they are the evidence behind
# every claim in AUDIT.md. Raw logs are not: some are hundreds of MB of
# progress-bar carriage returns, and one hit 775 MB on its own.
results-backup/**/logs/
results-backup/**/*.log
*.log

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Agent scratch. `.claude/worktrees/` holds full repo checkouts created for
# background agents; committing them would nest the repo inside itself.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.claude/
